Scraped from India Code handle 22075 — 69 sections. Full legal text of the Code on Wages, 2019. Consolidates and simplifies four existing labour laws: Payment of Wages Act 1936, Minimum Wages Act 1948, Payment of Bonus Act 1965, and Equal Remuneration Act 1976. Introduces universal minimum wage and floor wage concept. 264KB structured JSON. Source: indiacode.nic.in.